course: dictionary
lesson: 7353
title: One word, three meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning, and the words around them show which meaning the writer means. The word player is a good example. It can mean a person in a game, a person who plays music, or a machine.
explain: «The referee's word is final: a yellow card is a warning, and a red card sends a player off.» Ask yourself: who can be sent off? Only a person taking part in the game. The referee and the cards show that player means a person in a sport.
explain: «In Kai's game a player kept flying through walls.» Kai is playing a video game, so the player is the person controlling the character on screen. «A CD player» is different: it is a machine. If you see a word like «CD» or «disc» near player, think of the machine meaning.
fact: A player is a person who plays a game or a sport.
fact: A player can also be a person who plays music on an instrument, like a piano player.
fact: A player can be a machine that plays music or videos, like a CD player.
fact: In sport, teams have set numbers of players: 11 in soccer, 5 in basketball, 15 in rugby union and 9 in baseball.
exercise: «Sam Kerr and Alexia Putellas are among the world's best players.» What does player mean in this sentence? | A machine that plays videos | *A person who plays a sport | A person who plays the piano | A referee who blows the whistle
exercise: Maya says, «I put the disc in the player and the music started.» What kind of player is it? | *A machine that plays music | A person who plays football | A player on a team | A person who plays music
exercise: «She is a piano player, and every evening she plays for an hour.» What does player mean here? | *A person who plays music on an instrument | A person who plays a game | A machine that plays music | A star who wins the game
test: «In Kai's game a player kept flying through walls.» What is the player here? | A CD player | *A person playing a video game | A machine that plays videos | A referee
test: In soccer, how many players does each team have on the field? | 9 | 15 | *11 | 5
exam: «When cards are dealt, each player gets the same number.» If there are 4 players and each gets 5 cards, how many cards are dealt altogether? | *20 | 15 | 9 | 45
